WEBVTT

00:00.148 --> 00:10.197
Edit an Orkflow in the editor. Ctrl Space suggests keys and values.

00:10.197 --> 00:23.562
The engine checks the document as you type. A problem is underlined; fix it to apply.

00:23.562 --> 00:28.005
The panel beside the code shows the keys of the activity the cursor is in.

00:28.005 --> 00:49.615
Apply version stores an immutable version and its digest. A plan shows which tasks would run.

00:49.615 --> 00:58.123
Submit a run, and watch the graph fill in as each task starts and ends.
